Keywords     =ATK, AUIS, source development, multi-media
Comment1     =Installation instructions as ROOT:
Comment2     =   cd /
Comment3     =   tar xzf [path]/auis63L?-dev.tgz
Comment4     =   /usr/andrew/etc/complete-setup dev
Comment5     =   Read /usr/andrew/README.dev
